  "body": "This PR adds support for reception of ADS-B frames using LR2021. I was not yet able to test it due to bad antenna and not that much air traffic in here. I did try to align it as close as possible to existing LR2021 ADS-B demo here: https://theclams.github.io/2025/08/20/lr2021-adsb.html\r\n\r\nFrame decoding is based on descriptions here: https://mode-s.org/1090mhz/content/ads-b/1-basics.html\r\n\r\nUntested, so this will remain in draft until I can get a better antenna setup.",
